This is version 1.7 of elvis by Steve Kirkendallported to os9 by Peter Reinig.Repacked and brushed up by iMartin Gregorie and Peter SmuldersThis port is for the old Microware C compiler (V2.3)To install- check the makefile (BIN, ODIR, CFLAGS, PROGS)- type 'make'  this puts the executables in directory $(ODIR)- type 'make install'  this copies them to /dd/cmds- type 'make -i clob.os9' to clean up   (The -i option, ignore errors, is handy if you try   to delete nonexistent files)Example of file $HOME/.exrc:set autoindent autowrite showmatch wrapmargin=0 report=1set numberset showmode